	"VisualScript": {
		"Description": "Counts its entity's contacts: collisions and triggers that begin and end. At the first contact that ends, it checks that every contact that ended had begun (Checks counts it) and sets Done. The feature test's falling box and ball run it next to their C# CollisionProbe.",
